{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The exact two-multiply fusion is now 16/16 correct and gives consistent gains, but it leaves the sigmoid launch in place. Before touching either GEMM, I’m testing whether ROCm’s precise device exponential can reproduce PyTorch sigmoid bit-for-bit inside Triton; if it can, the entire activation can safely collapse to one pass."}}
